{"product_id":"guy-martin-road-racer","title":"Guy Martin: Road Racer","description":"\u003cp\u003eRoad racing photographer Stephen Davison has been photographing Guy Martin for all of his racing career and has amassed an archive of brilliant photographs. Edgy, extreme, intimate and quirky, Davison’s photographs brilliantly capture both Martin’s focus and determination, as well as his goofy and gauche side.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 229 x 286\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Davison Stephen\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780856409981\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820904702105,"sku":"17RC-59780856409981","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f9f69f6f108_Guy_Martin-_Road_Racer_Davison_Stephen.jpg?v=1761234453","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/guy-martin-road-racer","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}